    "UIName": "Great Wyrm 'Aemelia'",
    "Id": "mechdef_great_wyrm_GWY-A",
    "Name": "Great Wyrm 1",
    "Details": "This customized Clan 'Mech was created by an abandoned Clan Smoke Jaguar warrior named Aemelia on the Draconis Combine world of Rockland in 3062. She evaded capture by the forces of Operation: Bulldog and found herself alone for two years, waiting for word from a now dead Clan. She decided to patrol the world alone, dispatching pirates. She took a Great Wyrm BattleMech out of storage from a hidden Jaguar depot and removed ammunition-dependent weapons, replacing them with an ER large laser, a large pulse laser, and a pair of ER medium lasers and ER small lasers.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.09</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Upper</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_greatwyrm"
  },
